---
import { Radio, Sprout } from "@lucide/astro";
import { timeline } from "../data/site";
---

<section id="timeline" class="section timeline-section" aria-labelledby="timeline-heading">
  <div class="shell section-heading-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Open roadmap · 公開路線圖</p>
      <h2 id="timeline-heading">從籌備開始，<br />一起走到年會。</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">籌備從來不只發生在活動當天。這份時程讓每個想參與的人，都知道下一步會在哪裡發生。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="shell timeline-list">
    {timeline.map((item, index) => (
      <article class:list={["timeline-row", item.status]}>
        <div class="timeline-date">
          <span>{item.date}</span>
          {item.tentative && <small>預計</small>}
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true">
          {item.status === "event" ? <Sprout size={20} /> : <Radio size={18} />}
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-copy">
          <span class="timeline-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
          <h3>{item.title}</h3>
          <p>{item.description}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="shell disclaimer">
    <span aria-hidden="true">＊</span>
    <p>以下時程為目前預期資訊，實際安排以 SITCON 官方公告為準。</p>
  </div>
</section>
